# Day 31 – AI Supply Chain Control Tower

## Overview
Today I built an AI Supply Chain Control Tower using Claude AI. This interactive simulation demonstrates how modern businesses monitor supply chain operations in real time, prioritize incidents, and make operational decisions using AI-powered dashboards.

---

## Objectives

- Understand Supply Chain Control Towers
- Monitor operational alerts
- Prioritize incidents based on urgency
- Analyze business KPIs
- Improve operational decision-making
- Build an interactive HTML dashboard

