## Workflow

1. Generated the HTML application using Claude.
2. Opened the application in the browser.
3. Read the simulation instructions.
4. Monitored incoming operational alerts.
5. Prioritized incidents based on urgency.
6. Selected corrective actions.
7. Observed KPI changes after every decision.
8. Managed multiple alerts simultaneously.
9. Completed the simulation.
10. Reviewed the operational performance dashboard.

---

## Key Learnings

- A Control Tower provides real-time visibility across the supply chain.
- AI helps prioritize high-impact operational issues faster.
- Every business decision affects inventory, revenue, customer satisfaction, and operational costs.
- Dashboards enable data-driven decision making.
- Continuous monitoring improves business resilience.

